#4471 was filed as one known issue. The reports in it are separate problems. The table counts them from the export.

The shared parser reads a day-first date month-first. On booking-v3 the form hint says `MM/DD/YYYY`, people type the month first, and the form reads the day first. Some reports are a one-day move, which the desk noted and the cause table still files under the tenant.

